  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // T-875 (2026-11-16). Two host halves, each built on the operator-s answer to the question the
  // tracker line asked: TODOS item 51 — "Raise the bound to 128" — and TODOS item 62 — "No default:
  // the caller names a model". The context is its own on purpose: one set of these counts what a
  // single endpoint stores, the other reads one refusal, and neither may be measured out of a
  // context another card is already using. The fixture is 70 model rows because the fault was
  // measured at 66 against a bound of 64, and the two names a live engine lost were at positions
