      // the creation stamp each row carries (lib/index.js:2624-2633: "newest first by the creation stamp each row
      // carries, with the stored order kept only as the tiebreak"). My first version of this fixture wrote the ids
      // one way and the stamps the other, and the restore did what it is built to do — it re-ordered them — which is
