  // --- T-468 (2026-10-16, user ruling Q7): the download format, the twin it hands out, and the new item ---
  // The ruling, verbatim: "we should NOT replace the high-res wav with low-res mp3 or other formats if we can
  // avoid it for the workflows - so if default processing format we use is wav, try to keep it, and transcode
  // into copy for the user on DL request". Measured here against REAL files in the fake fs (opts.convert468).
