      + 'as — with the container the door actually serve put back on the end. Past the limit the name is cut AT THE '
      + 'END, so the words of the take give way while the id, the model and the voice stay whole, no dangling '
      + 'separator is left, and the row itself is untouched: a cap on a NAME is not a cap on a TAKE',
      stemLong468.length === 109 && nameLong468.length === 100
      && nameLong468.slice(0, 8) === 'ap-1004_' && /\.ogg$/.test(nameLong468)
      && rowLong468.dl_format === 'ogg'
